        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-teal-400 border-b border-gray-700 pb-4">ALLFORU - Sindh Teachers Portal</h1>
        
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-base">
            <p class="font-medium text-white text-lg">Welcome to ALLFORU</p>
            <p>ALLFORU - Sindh Teachers Portal ek educational platform hai jo khas tor par Sindh Government School Teachers ki madad aur rehnumai ke liye tayyar kiya gaya hai. Hamara maqsad teachers ko aise digital tools aur educational resources muhayya karna hai jo unke rozana ke taleemi aur idari (administrative) kaam ko aasaan, tez aur zyada munazzam bana saken.</p>
            <p>Hamari koshish hai ke technology ke zariye teachers ka qeemti waqt bachaya jaye taake woh apni tawajjo behtar taleem aur talaba ki taraqqi par markooz kar saken.</p>
            
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-teal-400 pt-4">Our Services</h2>
            <p>Filhal ALLFORU par ye services dastiyab hain:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-200">
                <li>📚 Sindh Primary Lesson Plan Generator</li>
                <li>💲 Sindh Government Salary Calculator 2026</li>
            </ul>
            <p>Lesson Plan Generator Sindh Textbook Board ke syllabus ke mutabiq tayyar kiya gaya hai aur teachers ko KG se Primary Classes tak rozana ke lesson plans chand seconds mein tayyar karne mein madad karta hai.</p>
            
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-teal-400 pt-4">Our Vision</h2>
            <p>Hamara vision ALLFORU ko Sindh ke teachers ke liye ek complete digital education portal banana hai, jahan ek hi jagah par har zaroori tool aur resource dastiyab ho.</p>
            
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-teal-400 pt-4">Upcoming Updates</h2>
            <p>Ham musalsal website ko behtar bana rahe hain. Aane wale updates mein:</p>
