                <li>🚀 Phase 2 mein Secondary Classes (Class 6-10) ke Lesson Plans shamil kiye jayenge.</li>
                <li>📂 Service Book Tools mutaarif karwaye jayenge:
                    <ul class="list-circle pl-6 mt-1 space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-300">
