                <li>📥 Educational Downloads aur mazeed digital resources</li>
            </ul>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-teal-400 pt-4">Feedback & Suggestions</h2>
            <p>Hamari website musalsal development ke marhale mein hai. Agar aap ko kisi bhi tool mein ghalti nazar aaye ya aap kisi naye feature ki tajweez dena chahein, to barah-e-karam hum se rabta karein. Aap ki raye hamare liye bohat ahmiyat rakhti hai aur isi ki bunyaad par hum website ko mazeed behtar banate rahenge.</p>

